# Context

## Why This Way
The comparison holds the model constant (GLM-5.3 served through
both harnesses) so the delta measures harness behavior: context
management, tool surface, and verify-command authorship. Run on
2026-10-11 right after the zcode adapter's live verification.

## Gotchas
- The pycache trap (unittest regenerates .pyc, failing the
  changed-files check) hits every fresh Python project; both
  arms hit it. Workers should gitignore build artifacts before
  the first verify.
- zcode's TMPDIR must stay short enough for Unix sockets; see
  the design note on b27673a.

